,"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"title":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOSuggestionChip/focusedValue(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"focusedValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip\/focusedvalue(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/focusedValue(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","title":"focusedValue(_:)"}}}